{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06JN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathit{Aut}(x') : \\mathcal{C}_{A'} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\text{id}_{x_0} \\in \\mathit{Aut}(x)(k)$", "MATH_0003": "$F = \\mathit{Aut}(x')_{\\text{id}_{x_0}}$", "MATH_0004": "$F$", "MATH_0005": "$TF \\otimes_k I$", "MATH_0006": "$\\text{Lift}(\\text{id}_x, A')$", "MATH_0007": "$\\text{Lift}(\\text{id}_x, A')$", "MATH_0008": "$$\nTF = T_{\\text{id}_{x_0}} \\mathit{Aut}(x') \\otimes_k I =\n\\text{Inf}_{x_0}(\\mathcal{F}) \\otimes_k I\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$\\text{Inf}(x'/x) = \\text{Lift}(\\text{id}_x, A')$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-free-transitive-action}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{remark-localize-cofibered-groupoid}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-Aut-functor-RS}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-localize-RS}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-free-transitive-action}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{lemma-Aut-functor-tangent-space}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{remark-infaut-lifting-equalities}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c400fa0541d4c2003720a7421bf5d6f4f02e313d8f5e63407873bff795e7f6e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0bc74dbea6f84e6ec2bf67fc94b02602681075ec32671b3fb261047c3dad78e8", "source_text": "This is just the analogue of\nLemma <REF_0001>\nin the setting of automorphism sheaves.\nTo be precise, we apply\nRemark <REF_0002>\nto the functor <MATH_0001>\nand the element <MATH_0002> to get\na predeformation functor <MATH_0003>. By\nLemmas <REF_0003> and <REF_0004>\n<MATH_0004> is a deformation functor. Hence\nLemma <REF_0005>\ngives a free and transitive action\nof <MATH_0005> on <MATH_0006>, because as\n<MATH_0007> is a group it is always nonempty.\nNote that we have equalities of vector spaces\n<MATH_0008>\nby\nLemma <REF_0006>.\nThe equality <MATH_0009> of\nRemark <REF_0007>\nfinishes the